id: pm-rust-f2nv
title: Converge changelog generation and verification on replace mode
description: "The release workflow regenerates CHANGELOG.md in prepend mode while the changelog gate verifies in replace mode, an unsatisfiable combination. Converge both on replace mode."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: changelog,ci,release
created_at: "2026-08-09T20:15:03.617Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T20:55:46.548Z"
deadline: "2026-08-11T20:15:03.617Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T20:16:22.615Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T20:16:22.615Z"
author: pi-agent
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "just changelog-check passes against a replace-mode CHANGELOG.md; cargo build, cargo test, and cargo clippy pass; the release workflow CHANGELOG generate and check lines use replace mode"
parent: pm-rust-u4al
resolution: Made justfile changelog-check delegate to changelog-full --check and switched the release.yml CHANGELOG generate+check lines to --mode replace --all-release-tags.
expected_result: just changelog-check passes against a replace-mode CHANGELOG.md; generation and verification share one render and cannot drift.
actual_result: "cargo +1.90.0 build, clippy (-D warnings), and 13 tests pass; just changelog-full regenerates idempotently; just changelog-check passes."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-rust-u4al,related,"2026-08-09T20:15:03.617Z",pi-agent,"cli:create:dep",asserted
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:15:03.617Z",pi-agent,Changelog generation and verification must share one render mode
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:15:03.617Z",pi-agent,justfile changelog-check now delegates to changelog-full --check
  "2026-08-09T20:15:17.157Z",pi-agent,"Converging changelog generation/verification on replace mode. justfile: changelog-full is now variadic and changelog-check delegates to `just changelog-full --check` so generation and verification share one render. release.yml: CHANGELOG generate+check lines switched from --mode prepend --since-previous-tag --until-release-tag to --mode replace --all-release-tags (keeping --date and all other flags); release notes --stdout line left windowed."
  "2026-08-09T20:55:46.528Z",claude,"A reviewer found that release-check ends in changelog-check,which regenerated with the hardcoded CHANGELOG_DATE while the release job had stamped the tag-derived release date into the heading,so every release on a day other than 2026-08-07 would have rejected the changelog it had just written. A nested just call starts a new process and does not inherit a command-line variable override,so the value is now forwarded explicitly at each hop and the workflow passes the release date in"
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T20:15:03.617Z",pi-agent,A check that regenerates in a different mode than generation is an unsatisfiable gate
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project,CHANGELOG generate and check lines switched to replace mode
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  just changelog-check,project,240
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project,Regenerated with replace mode
close_reason: Converged changelog generation and verification on replace mode.
body: "Mirror the fleet-wide changelog mode convergence: have the changelog-check recipe delegate to the replace-mode full render, and switch the release workflow CHANGELOG generate and check lines to --mode replace --all-release-tags. Release notes stay windowed to the new release."
